+++ b/README.md
@@ -21,6 +21,18 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Command line
+
+> java -jar cli/target/cli-1.0-jar-with-dependencies.jar <command> <options>
+
+* `init`: creates an analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports`: generates Sokrates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/index.html`), aggregating the results of multiple analyses
+* `updateLandscape`: the same as `analyzeLandscape` (older name, kept for existing scripts)
+* `updateConfig`: updates an analysis configuration file and completes missing fields
+
+Use `<command> -help` for the options of a command.
+
